  "prefLabel": "He-P 3202.03 Category",
  "priorExpiration": "1994-10-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3202.03 Category. All applicants shall be pregnant, breastfeeding, or postpartum women, infants, or children under age 5 as verified by information such as one of the following:\n\n(a) Health care provider documentation of applicant’s pregnancy unless visibly pregnant; or\n\n(b) Applicant’s birth certificate containing date of birth as documentation of age.\n\nSource. #4518, eff 10-28-88; EXPIRED 10-28-94\n\nNew. #6226, eff 4-24-96; ss by #7489, eff 5-11-01; ss by #7774, eff 10-8-02; ss by #8580, eff 3-11-06; ss by #9556, eff 10-1-09; ss by #10583, eff 10-1-14; ss by #12858, eff 8-23-19",
